Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:35.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}汝弃绝撒旦吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abrenuntias satanae?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:38.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾弃绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abrenuntio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:51.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾兹为汝施洗 奉圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ego te baptizo,in nomine Patris...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:57.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣子 圣灵之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et Filii,et Spiritus Sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.59,0:02:10.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一路平安 愿主与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vade in pace,et Dominus vobiscum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:12.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无限恩慈的主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God,of infinite goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请赐美满恒久的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}send prosperous life and long
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:32.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}予无比尊贵的英格兰公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the high and mighty Princess of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:34.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不许有人质疑生育非法与否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There can be no question of illegitimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你立即起草一份法案呈交国会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will prepare a bill to put before Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:08.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}规定王位第一顺位继承权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will state that the line of succession
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.03,0:03:11.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确属我们的子嗣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is now firmly vested in our children...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:13.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而非他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:16.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谨遵陛下谕令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall do as Your Majesty commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 我心知肚明 依然有些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am mindful,Mr. Cromwell,that there are some people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:22.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些榆木脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some wrong headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:25.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些存有偏见的人 不会愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some biased people who are still unwilling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:28.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接受我与王后婚姻的有效合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to accept the validity of my marriage to the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鉴于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In view of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:34.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想制定些约束法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think some sanction should be made against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:38.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以让人人都有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone will be given their opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:40.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来表现他们的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to demonstrate their loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:45.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勒德洛城堡 威尔士边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ludlow castle,The Welsh Marches
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:49.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说那女士因生了个女儿沮丧不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am told that the Lady is much dismayed at having given birth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:53.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而非以前信誓旦旦的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a daughter and not the son she promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:57.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以我之见 这是主抛弃她的确凿证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To my mind,it is sure proof that God has abandoned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:01.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我母亲 王后 近来如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is my mother, the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:05.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哎呀 我没法去看她 或与她讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas,I cannot visit or speak to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:08.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟她的侍女聊过几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have little communications with her ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们告诉我她依然坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they tell me she is still strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:14.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但一直在恳求国王 你的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but always begs the King,your father,of his mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:17.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望他出于怜悯 允许她与你会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be allowed to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信陛下有朝一日总会回心转意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure His Majesty will one day relent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:27.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全然相信他仍然爱我 关心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe with all my heart that he still loves and cares for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我深有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure that he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滕斯托尔主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bishop Tunstall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:40.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何有幸使尊驾光临？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To what do I owe this honour?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们相识久矣 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have known each other a long time,Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:05:02.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今您退隐 无从谋面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now you have retired from public life and I never see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自然该前来问安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naturally I was concerned about your welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:07.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我过的不错 多谢关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am very well,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我焦虑的是我们的另一位老相识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am exorcised by the fact that one of our old acquaintances
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:20.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 却一直被软禁家中 - 你指费施尔主教？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- is still under house arrest. - You mean Bishop Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:25.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 结局让人很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, the outcome is regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么样的"结局"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The "outcome" of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不妥协的"结局"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His intransigence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:35.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开门见山吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是国王派您登门拜访的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has the King sent you here to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下希望了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty wondered
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:46.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何您未应邀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why you did not attend the Queen's Coronation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参加王后加冕典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you were invited to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:51.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于此事 让我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, in answer to that,let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我对你粗表愚见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let me show my poor mind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:06:00.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个关于提庇留大帝的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a story about the Emperor Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:04.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他颁布一项法律 规定某种犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had enacted a law which exacted death
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:08.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可判处死刑 除非犯罪者是处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for a certain crime... unless the offender was a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可最终当一个处女被如此指控时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,when a virgin eventually appeared on the charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:14.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝却不知该如何下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Emperor didn't know exactly how to proceed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:18.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此他的一名议员提出个绝佳的解决方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so one of his council proposed the perfect solution:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:20.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先辣手摧花使她失贞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let her first be deflowered,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:24.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因而她就可被依律处死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so she then can be... devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:26.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are some...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我就不指名道姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no,I won't name them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:32.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们先引诱你去加冕礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who first procure you for the coronation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:36.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后就大肆渲染 甚至白纸黑字立此存照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}next to preach at it,and then to write books defending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:38.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从而先玷污你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thus they deflower you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:42.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后就可轻而易举地置你于死地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will not fail soon afterwards to devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他们永远也别妄想玷污我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they shall never deflower me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:22.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太动听了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您也热衷此道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:38.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一向如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:55.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 埃莉诺女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty. - Lady Eleanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:28.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:30.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要像这样 看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More like this. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:33.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手指像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fingers like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要捏箭太紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't squeeze the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拉弓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Draw...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:40.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后放箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and release.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我永远办不到 - 不 你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'll never do that. - Yes,you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:52.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大臣阁下 - 公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Secretary. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:57.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你的儿子？- 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And your son? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}趁还没太老以前 教他些运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm teaching him to sport before I get too old for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你射箭吗 克伦威尔？- 有时候 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you shoot,Cromwell? - Sometimes,Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王有何吩咐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does the King want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:39.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下希望你和你的妻子回宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty would like to see you back at court. With your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:42.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 他想念大人你陪伴左右了 - 还有呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He misses Your Grace's company. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:48.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下知道您是亲皇派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty is aware that you favour the Imperialist cause
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:50.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您在议会上直言不讳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you say so openly in Council
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:56.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 另外你也许极为同情亲王太妃？- 你不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- and have,perhaps,a great sympathy for the Dowager Princess? - Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说实话 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:01.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是没心没肺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not heartless,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管有些人怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever some people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰恰相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quite the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:08.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我效忠国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I serve the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下意欲将王位继承权授予\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty intends to vest the succession
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:16.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他与安妮王后的子嗣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the children he will have with Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关法案会呈交国会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A bill will go before Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想了解您是否支持他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to know if he'll have your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:36.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}饿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shh... Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:51.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你在做什么？- 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What are you doing? - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道我不可以给她喂奶吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I not feed her from my own breast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后不做此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tsk,tsk. Queens don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别是不会给女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}especially not for a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:01.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把她交给奶妈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give her back to her wet-nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:16.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公主将在哈菲尔德拥有自己的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Princess will shortly be given her own establishment at Hatfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:20.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽女士也同别人一起前去听候差遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Among others, the Lady Mary will attend and wait on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你指凯瑟琳的女儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让她明白一下自己的新位置也好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is well that she knows her new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大臣在安排一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Secretary Cromwell is arranging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会给你生个儿子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will still give you a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come soon,my darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到我热情的床上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to my hot bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:54.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:57.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱丽丝 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alice,children...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的家人 我有事要宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear family,I have something to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:13.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的收入现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My income is now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:16.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大不如前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so greatly reduced,that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能再按以前的生活标准生活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we can no longer go on living as we are accustomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的国王补助金已被取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no longer the recipient of the King's bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:26.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:29.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生活必须从俭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must live frugally
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:34.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缩减家用开销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and reduce my household.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:37.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以自食其力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those of you who can must live in your own houses
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:40.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另立门户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and eat at your own tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:43.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但是 父亲 - 就此决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But,Father... - No. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凡事总是会有变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Things inevitably must change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:50.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们不能永远被供养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't all be supported forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生活并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life is not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现实的生活是残酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Real life is raw
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:59.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而艰难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:02.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们必须面对现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you must face up to that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则就会更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If not to even worse things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行了 我们吃饭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. Let us eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:26.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈福德郡 哈菲尔德宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hatfield House Hertfordshire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:35.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布赖恩夫人 玛莉小姐到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lady Mary,Lady Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:38.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎来到哈菲尔德 你的新家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome to Hatfield,your new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:44.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是公主的家庭教师 玛格丽特·布赖恩夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Lady Margaret Bryan,the Princess's Governess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:46.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他侍女都在此照顾公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These other Ladies are also here to attend the Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as of course are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉小姐 请允许我向你介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary,may I present you to her Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白公主殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Princess Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人会带你去自己的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be shown to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:04.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早间祷告之后 你就可以开始工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will begin your duties in the mornings,after prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:08.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要单独祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall say my prayers alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.05,0:14:11.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你的房间 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your room,my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:19.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了圣诞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:24.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么人越老 越觉得每天都是圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why is it that as you get older,it always seems to be Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:27.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 对你永远是圣诞节 不是吗 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course,it is always Christmas for you,isn't it,my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:31.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您原本男爵而又获封一些新头衔 请指教一下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Baron in your own right now,and some new titles. Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:36.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}御犬总监 南方五港总督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master of Buckhounds. Lord Warden of the Cinque Ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对了 是不是还有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah. Was there not another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:41.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为疯子开的伯利恒精神病院院长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master of the Bedlam Hospital for the insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打算去看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you plan to visit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:49.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是说作为病人进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't mean as an inmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:54.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拜读过你关于宫廷生活的讽刺诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I read one of your satires about life here at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我是你 我会谨慎行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I were you,I'd be more careful
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些你所取笑的人完全有能力伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about poking fun at those who have the power to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:04.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是些友善的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's just friendly advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here,my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:25.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一件礼物送给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:33.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太妙了 是谁的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's fantastic! Who made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:39.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此人很有天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:42.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是 我美丽的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As are you,my beautiful Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:55.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还可以下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could still do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以找机会下毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could find a way to poison her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:59.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不 - 但是我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. - But I thought that was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:02.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这会连累我的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be blamed on my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:04.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前并不需要动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the moment,he doesn't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:07.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还要处理与土耳其的对战事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has a war with the Turks to contend with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:10.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但为什么要让世人皆知 - 别傻了 布里列顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But why should anyone ever know? - Don't be stupid,Brereton.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会查出你 然后折磨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They would find you and torture you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:16.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你会供出一切的 - 不 我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- and you would tell them everything. - No,I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:18.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会壮烈殉教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd die a martyr's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:24.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不像是能经受得了折磨的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've never seen a man being tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:29.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切勿单独行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 圣诞节愉快 - 陛下同乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Happy Christmas. - And to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:48.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我有件礼物呈献给您 - 在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I have a gift for you. - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:53.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得等到新一轮的国会会议 是臣的支持票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll have to wait until the new session of Parliament-for it's my vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有何必曾对你所怀疑呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could I have ever doubted you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:19.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃莉诺·鲁克 注意到国王看她的眼神了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eleanor Luke. You see the way the King looks at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:22.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是国王的情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's his mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除掉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:35.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 玛莉 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mary. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:38.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得给你物色名新夫婿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must find you a new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:47.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我还有一件礼物奉上 - 是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I have another gift for you. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:52.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又有身孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am with child again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:11.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 议员们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,Councillors
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:15.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是新的继承法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}here is the new Act,the Act of Succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:19.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我奉命即刻传达给国会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I am commanded to present shortly to the Houses of Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法案提名陛下与安妮王后所生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Act nominates the children born
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:25.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}子女为第一顺位继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of His Majesty and Queen Anne as first rightful heirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此法案在于保护本国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By so doing,it protects this nation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:29.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重蹈四分五裂的复辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the great divisions it has suffered in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:32.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸侯觊觎宝座已久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when several different titles have pretended to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:37.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法案谨此作为警示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Act warns that anyone saying or writing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:40.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若有损害或诽谤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anything to the prejudice or slander
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:42.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王与其至亲至爱的安妮王后的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the lawful matrimony between the King
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}合法婚姻及后嗣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his most dear and entirely beloved wife Queen Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or against his heirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:50.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将以叛国罪论处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would be guilty of high treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:53.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}处以极刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for which the penalty is death
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:56.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其财产收归王室所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and forfeiture of goods to the Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:00.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"新法案要求所有臣民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The new Act requires all the King's subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:03.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进行宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"if so commanded,to swear an oath
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们将忠实 坚定 不懈 确实地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"that they shall truly,firmly,constantly,without fraud and guile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:10.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵守 履行 维护 保护 维持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"observe,fulfil,maintain,defend and keep
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:14.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法令的全部内容和效力"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the whole contents and effect of the Bill."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:17.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此项宣誓同样需要承认国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This oath will also require recognition
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:18.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一切事务上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the King's supremacy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:22.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至高无上的地位 无论精神信仰或俗世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all matters,spiritual and temporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:25.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若有违抗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who refuse to take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:28.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将视为叛国罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be accounted guilty of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:31.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}投入监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and sent to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.43,0:20:36.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做得不错 大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is all well done,Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚合我意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:43.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终究还是需要宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it must be sworn by oath,after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:49.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:21:00.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]我信唯一 至圣 至公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Et unam sanctam catholicam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.16,0:21:03.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]由使徒传下的教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et apostolicam ecclesian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]以圣父 圣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In nomine Patris et Fillii.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:14.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]圣灵的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et Spiritu Sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.65,0:21:21.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王还是如此冥顽不灵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the King remain obdurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.45,0:21:23.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他拒绝听取建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He refuses to listen to advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:29.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强迫所有信徒破坏他们的誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he forces all true believers to perjure their immortal souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:31.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 此话怎讲？- 他们必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How so? - They must all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:35.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣誓国王是英国教会之首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}swear an oath that the King is head of the English church.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:38.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如有违抗即被关进监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who refuse are put in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:41.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同我们基督里的弟兄 费施尔主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like our brother in Christ,Bishop Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:43.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:45.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:48.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦狼进入羊栏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The shepherd cannot stand idly by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威吓羊群之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while the wolf enters the fold
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:53.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牧羊人是不会袖手旁观的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and threatens his flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:57.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决定任命费施尔为红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have decided to make Fisher a Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把他的冠冕送到英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will send his hat to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来看看国王是否胆敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's see if the King is still prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:08.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指控 折磨一位教会亲王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to prosecute and torture a Prince of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布赖恩夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! Mistress Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 早安 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- A very good morning to you. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:40.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在巡行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm on progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:43.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来探望我的女儿 她怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've come to see my daughter. How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:47.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她各方面都会令陛下感到无上光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is a credit to Your Majesty in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:54.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:02.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说不定 布赖恩夫人 也许有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who knows,Mistress Bryan,perhaps one day
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个小姑娘会统治整个王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this little girl will preside over empires.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:12.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:13.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有太多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:35.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢尔等照料我们心爱的公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for all your care toward our beloved Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:39.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.77,0:24:31.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃莉诺夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eleanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.21,0:24:33.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:38.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为别人发现不了你的秘密？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you suppose no one would find out your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.12,0:24:41.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 今天 - 你的房间被搜查过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I... - Your chamber was searched today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.69,0:24:47.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现了一些珠宝 你没有将它们藏匿妥当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The jewels were found. You did not hide them well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.46,0:24:50.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 珠宝？我不… - 王后陛下的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Jewels...? I don't... - Her Majesty's jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.29,0:24:52.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你偷窃的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ones you stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.13,0:24:55.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不可能 - 我说千真万确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's not true! - And I say it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:58.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的偷窃罪行一旦曝光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if your crimes were ever reported,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:02.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还指望谁能相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who do you suppose would believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.87,0:25:06.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟 埃莉诺夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all,Lady Eleanor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.61,0:25:09.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人会凭白无故控告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no one could accuse you of being innocent...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.34,0:25:10.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.75,0:25:15.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What am I to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.12,0:25:17.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离开宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave court.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.19,0:25:20.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go back to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:23.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看他们是否还欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See if they will have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.83,0:26:09.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛琪表妹 谢尔顿夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cousin Madge! Lady Sheldon,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.92,0:26:13.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你们在看什么？- 没什么 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What are you reading? - Nothing,my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:15.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是… 一些诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just some... poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.22,0:26:17.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·怀特爵士写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By Sir Thomas Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:21.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:28.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们不应该在这种小事上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should not be wasting your time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:29.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on such trifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:33.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你们一定要在侍奉我的时候读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you must read,when you are supposed to be attending on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:35.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就去读那本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you should read that book!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.42,0:26:38.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们将学到更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will learn a great deal more from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.61,0:26:40.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许会更聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perhaps even some wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:42.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:45.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在去做正经事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now go about your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:26:59.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下 威尔特郡伯爵驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl of Wiltshire,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:05.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:07.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.51,0:27:12.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看起来不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.75,0:27:15.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你已开始能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I believe you're already showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.55,0:27:19.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点点 您去巴黎的旅行如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A little. How was your trip to Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:24.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国国王可不好对付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King Francis is not the easiest man to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.92,0:27:27.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他送来结婚礼物给你 但他装作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sends you wedding presents,yet he pretends
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.02,0:27:29.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不能正式承认你是王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he cannot officially recognize you as Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:31.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为凯瑟琳还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as Katherine remains alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.50,0:27:35.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.44,0:27:38.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的状态该会让他很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must be pleased at your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:42.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 不过… ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He is. - But...?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:46.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:53.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但在我上次怀孕的时候 国王有了个情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But when I was last with child,the King took a mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:55.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:58.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今我怕他会重蹈旧辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now I fear he will take another,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我必须为了孩子而小心谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since I must be careful for the sake of the child
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:04.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能让他和我鱼水之欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and not let him enjoy his conjugal rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.30,0:28:09.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于男人而言这是正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is natural for a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:12.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当他的妻子怀孕而不愿和他同床时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when his wife is big with child and not willing to lie with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.80,0:28:17.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然会出去找点其它暂时的抚慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to find some temporary consolation elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.44,0:28:21.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而对于国王来说 更是合乎情理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for Kings,it is properly expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:24.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:27.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听我说 你的和我们的危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}listen to me. The danger to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.46,0:28:29.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并非国王有了情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to us,is not that the King takes a mistress...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:33.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是他找错了情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but that he takes the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.65,0:28:36.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不仅不服我们掌控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone we can't control,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.09,0:28:39.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还会寻求掌控国王的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or who would seek to control the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.15,0:28:44.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果假设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if you suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.27,0:28:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王确实会有情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the King is sure to take a mistress,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.37,0:28:48.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么一定要确保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:51.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}情妇是你的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she is your choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.89,0:28:54.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and not his.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.09,0:29:04.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得向国王汇报了 一会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must make my report to the King. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.77,0:29:37.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大臣阁下 - 尊敬的费施尔主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Secretary. - Reverend Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来就想看看他们有没有好好待你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just came to see if you were being well treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.85,0:29:44.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样说的话 我这衰老的胃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As to that,my aged stomach
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:47.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应负不了狱卒送来的腐臭的饭菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cannot cope with the rank food the jailor brings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:52.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那没什么 因为那只是身体上的折磨 而无关灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that is nothing,since it pertains to my body and not my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:05.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还没接受宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not taken the Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:08.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 没有 - 为什么不？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:14.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不认为国王的婚姻合理合法？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you refuse to accept that the King's marriage is proper and legal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:18.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信陛下他这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe His Majesty thinks it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.24,0:30:19.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你不？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:21.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.03,0:30:24.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只相信我一直坚信的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe what I have always believed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.13,0:30:28.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王与凯瑟琳的婚姻仍然有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the King's marriage to Queen Katherine is still valid,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.79,0:30:30.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}且不能被任何人破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and can be undone by no man,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.65,0:30:33.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是克莱默大主教也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not even Archbishop Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.92,0:30:44.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你现在质疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And do you dispute
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:46.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王现在是教会的最高领袖？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the King is Supreme Head of the Church now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:49.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我毫不犹豫的质疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I do. Most emphatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:53.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王只是国君 绝非世间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King our Sovereign Lord is not the Supreme Head on earth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.44,0:30:54.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰教会的最高领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Church of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.13,0:31:00.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.82,0:31:03.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is Sir Thomas More?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.23,0:31:16.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:20.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.45,0:31:24.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看饭菜的质量能不能提高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see if the quality of your food can be improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.25,0:31:28.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.43,0:31:39.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么要驱逐埃莉诺夫人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you get rid of Lady Eleanor?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.05,0:31:44.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她偷了我珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She stole something precious from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.67,0:31:48.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定是她偷的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure she stole it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:50.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. I had the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:51.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.54,0:31:58.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望陛下不至于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope Your Majesty is not
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.36,0:31:59.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太失望？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}too disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.05,0:32:05.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.79,0:32:09.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有些东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:15.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.62,0:32:40.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.77,0:32:58.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.48,0:33:14.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是何事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.85,0:33:19.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 有一些小修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,there are a number of small monastic institutions
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.87,0:33:21.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有理由相信 需要调查一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had cause to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.21,0:33:24.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修道士们不愿意接受誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The monks there refuse to take the Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.05,0:33:26.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起您 他们更愿意效忠罗马教廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'd rather serve the Vicar of Rome than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.86,0:33:31.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是关于遣散他们的议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a Bill for their dissolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这笔可观的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very considerable wealth of these houses
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.30,0:33:38.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随即将被转到您的国库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will thus be transferred to Your Majesty's exchequer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:54.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接下来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:59.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我刚刚听说教皇意欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,I have just heard that the Pope intends
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.18,0:34:01.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任命费施尔神父为红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make Reverend Fisher a Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:07.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然他已经派发了主教冠冕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently he has already despatched a Cardinal's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:10.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔将把它戴在肩膀上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then Fisher will have to wear it upon his shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.43,0:34:14.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为当帽子到达时 费施尔将已经被处死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For by the time it gets here,he won't have a head to put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.29,0:34:19.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫尔是什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of More?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.94,0:34:22.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他接受誓言吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will he take the oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.81,0:34:29.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她怎么样？吃的怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is she? Does she feed well?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:32.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 他一切都好 几乎没怎么哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is good in every way,Your Majesty. And hardly cries at all
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.18,0:34:34.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就好像她已经知道她是公主了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as if she already knows that she is a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.30,0:34:39.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你 伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you,Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.76,0:34:42.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全身心的爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you with all my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:45.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你永不被忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I bid you never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.35,0:34:52.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘘… 嘘…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shh... shh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.67,0:34:53.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.25,0:35:01.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我离开前 我想和玛莉女士说几句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before I leave,I wish to say something to the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.55,0:35:16.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉女士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.65,0:35:24.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉女士 我怀着善意而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary,I am here in kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.82,0:35:26.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想欢迎你回到宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would welcome you back to court,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.85,0:35:28.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并促使你和你父亲和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and reconcile you with your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.03,0:35:31.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你接受我是王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you will only accept me as Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.07,0:35:40.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了母亲 我不认为任何人是王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I recognize no Queen but my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.24,0:35:44.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果国王的情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if the King's mistress
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.65,0:35:47.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乐意代我向国王说情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would intercede with the King on my behalf...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.99,0:35:51.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我会很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I would be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:13.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 托马斯·莫尔爵士来访 - 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sir Thomas More. - Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.54,0:36:14.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.93,0:36:20.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐 这是非正式会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please be seated. This is but an informal occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.77,0:36:22.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来杯酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A little ale,perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.25,0:36:23.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.45,0:36:40.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你我都知道我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure we both know the object
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.21,0:36:41.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在在这里的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which has brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.33,0:36:45.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有很多关于你的谣言 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is very widely rumoured,Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.66,0:36:49.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将拒绝接受继承誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you will refuse to take the Oath of Succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.18,0:36:53.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很开诚布公的跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say this to you very openly and sincerely:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:56.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不希望一个多年来侍奉吾王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I wish no harm to come to a great man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:36:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蒙受王恩的为人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who has for years enjoyed and deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.24,0:36:59.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受到任何伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty's good graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:04.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿看到我儿子死 也不愿你受伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rather lose my own son than see any hurt come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.60,0:37:09.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能听听你对国王新婚的意见吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask your opinion of the King's new marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.03,0:37:12.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.21,0:37:17.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我既没有说闲话 也没有私下议论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I neither murmur at it,nor dispute upon it;
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.04,0:37:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会 永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never did and never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:24.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么对于吾王的"英格兰教会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what of His Majesty's claim to Supremacy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:26.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最高领袖"你有何见解？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}over the Church in England?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.10,0:37:32.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本来我对此事仍不能确定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was unsure about this matter
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.49,0:37:37.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到我重读了陛下写的手册:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I re-read His Majesty's own pamphlet:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.36,0:37:39.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3} 《为七项圣礼辩护》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The "Assertio septum Sacramentorum".
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.04,0:37:42.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.78,0:37:45.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这里有个副本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a copy of it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.96,0:37:48.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 在这本手册里 吾王确定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course,in the pamphlet,the King asserts
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.02,0:37:51.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇制度的神圣起源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the divine origin of the papacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.75,0:37:54.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇的权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Pope's supremacy descends directly
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.13,0:37:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从圣彼得磐石上直接传承下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the Rock of St. Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.55,0:37:59.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你会发现陛下的一些论点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you'll find His Majesty's arguments are as...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.20,0:38:02.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论是当时还是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}persuasive and powerful now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.43,0:38:04.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都很有说服力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as they were when he first wrote them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.55,0:38:12.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会宣誓吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you take the Oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.70,0:38:15.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我不用提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need hardly remind you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.98,0:38:17.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不这么做会有什么后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the consequences of not doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.30,0:38:20.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:24.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对国王无比衷心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the King's loyal subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.94,0:38:26.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会出口对他不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say no harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.35,0:38:28.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会图谋对他不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think no harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.61,0:38:31.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也只希望每人都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I wish everybody good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.98,0:38:35.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有此良好信念仍不足以使人存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if this be not enough to keep a man alive,in good faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:40.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我也不想残喘于世了 - 托马斯阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I long not to live. - Sir Thomas...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.78,0:38:43.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该知道国王陛下完全不想强迫你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should know that the King himself has no mind
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:47.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只是希望你通情达理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to coerce you. He simply asks you to relent
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.90,0:38:51.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屈就于他的请求 答应去宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and condescend to his request that you take the Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.39,0:38:57.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 请代向国王转达我无比忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell,please impart to the King my utter faithfulness,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.47,0:39:01.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真诚 和对他的忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}truthfulness,and loyalty to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.11,0:39:49.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛琪表妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cousin Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.48,0:39:52.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:55.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来和我聊聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.34,0:40:12.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你一定有很多仰慕者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose you have many admirers?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.98,0:40:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.47,0:40:18.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我一直记得王后陛下的教导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I always remember what Your Majesty told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.81,0:40:22.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能放荡 要有一个标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about not being lewd and setting a standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.73,0:40:25.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你一定是这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.31,0:40:31.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你会不会很惊讶 如果得知你的仰慕者中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But would it surprise you to learn that one of your admirers
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:33.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.87,0:40:37.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.03,0:40:38.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.56,0:40:49.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 你会不会更惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,would it surprise you even more if I told you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.30,0:40:52.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我说我会许可你做他的情人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you would have my blessing to become his mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.39,0:40:57.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.29,0:41:00.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我怀着孩子的时候 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While I am with child,His Majesty needs to be able to lie
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.66,0:41:02.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要有另一个女人陪着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.76,0:41:05.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是很有激情的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a passionate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.99,0:41:09.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那个女人 必须是我能够信任的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But she must be someone I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.17,0:41:11.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的家庭 也是我信任的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whose family I can trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.67,0:41:12.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.90,0:41:15.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.60,0:41:17.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是改革运动的支持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you are reformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:24.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的王后陛下 我已经乐意的宣誓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty. We all gladly took the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.24,0:41:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你乐意将国王带上你的床吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now will you gladly take the King to your bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.36,0:41:37.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇室使臣阁下觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Excellency,the Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.70,0:41:43.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 阁下 - 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Excellency. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.01,0:41:47.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您原谅 我特来请求您的怜悯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me,but I come here upon a mission of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.43,0:41:51.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 怜悯？- 是的 您的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mercy? - Very much so. Your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.80,0:41:53.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽女士病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Lady Mary,has fallen ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:55.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的医生也是这么认为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even to the concern of her doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.31,0:42:00.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我捎来了一封她母亲写的信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a letter written by her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.15,0:42:05.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她想照顾她的孩子 她在信中说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She would like to nurse her child. She writes...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.85,0:42:06.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以念吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.06,0:42:15.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我带去的一点点安慰和欢乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"A little comfort and mirth with me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.29,0:42:17.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就可以使她痊愈一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would be a half health to her."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.99,0:42:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以亲自照顾她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I could care for her with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.19,0:42:23.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲自为她铺床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and put her in my own bed
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.87,0:42:25.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在她需要时照看着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and watch with her when needful."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.48,0:42:38.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会派我的私人医师给她做检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will send my personal physician to examine and help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.12,0:42:42.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不能允许玛丽和她妈妈在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I cannot allow Mary and her mother to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.29,0:42:44.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:47.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是一个普通的母亲对她亲生女儿的心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is just the cry of any mother for any daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.55,0:42:51.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是问题所在 她们不是普通的母女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's just it! They are not just any mother or daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.14,0:42:55.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定她们不会联合起来密谋反抗我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you not suppose they would conspire to plot against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.16,0:42:57.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.27,0:43:00.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然这么认为了 你知道会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course you can believe it! You know it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.94,0:43:04.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候生病被用于政治目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that sometimes illness is used for political purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.71,0:43:06.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you not believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.65,0:43:09.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳想让她的女儿成为居于人上的女王吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine wants Mary to be Queen above all else?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.96,0:43:11.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔普斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.03,0:43:15.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳夫人是一个骄傲顽固的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine is a very proud stubborn woman
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.14,0:43:18.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也拥有十足的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of very great and high courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.08,0:43:21.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可以召集一个军队 占领一方土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She could muster an army,take the field
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.58,0:43:23.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后对我发动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and wage a war against me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.18,0:43:26.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像她的母亲伊莎贝拉在西班牙曾发动的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as fierce as any her mother Isabella ever waged in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that not true?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:39.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经被召唤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been handed a summons...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.41,0:43:41.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至朗伯斯宫(坎特伯雷大主教官邸)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to appear at Lambeth Palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.51,0:43:44.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去参加宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to take the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.01,0:43:47.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想之后我会被监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I imagine I shall be imprisoned afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.07,0:43:49.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:52.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要互相照顾对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be good to each other
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.21,0:43:55.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也要对其他人好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.27,0:43:59.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or,if you cannot be good,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.29,0:44:03.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少尽量不做坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be the least bad you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.83,0:44:36.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,darling,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.87,0:45:10.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢尔顿女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.87,0:45:14.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 王后呢？- 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where's the Queen? - Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.95,0:45:17.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后觉得有些不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Queen is feeling indisposed
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.06,0:45:19.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望您能原谅她今早不骑马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and asks you to forgive her not riding this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.68,0:45:25.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 当然 - 她说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Of course. - She...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:29.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不知道国王陛下愿不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wondered if Your Majesty would be pleased if...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.75,0:45:34.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我代替她 我是说 骑马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I took her place. Riding, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.79,0:45:41.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果王后同意了 为什么不呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the Queen gives her permission, then why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.68,0:45:42.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢尔顿女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.28,0:46:25.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朗伯斯宫 伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lambeth Palace, London
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.67,0:47:00.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你叫什么名字 谢尔顿女士 - 玛格丽特 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's your name,Lady Sheldon? - Margaret,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.98,0:47:03.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管大家都叫我玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though people call me Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.11,0:47:07.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我叫你玛琪 可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I shall call you Madge-if you'll allow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.77,0:47:09.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:38.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.98,0:47:41.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你准备好要宣誓了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you now ready to swear the oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.76,0:47:44.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.07,0:47:56.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.54,0:48:03.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.63,0:48:11.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是想指责这份誓言或者它的撰写者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't mean to put at fault this oath or its makers
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.23,0:48:12.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更没有说对它宣誓的人有什么过错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or any man who swears to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.71,0:48:16.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远都不会谴责任何人的道德标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will never condemn the conscience of any other man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.96,0:48:20.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是对我本人而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But for myself,in good faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.13,0:48:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受良心驱使 我仅对继承人的合法性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my own conscience so moves me that I will swear to the validity
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.38,0:48:27.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表示认同 而不是其他部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the succession-yet not the rest of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.52,0:48:30.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以免我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without jeopardizing my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.58,0:48:32.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遭受永久的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to perpetual damnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.84,0:48:35.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们很遗憾听到你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are very sorry to hear you say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.19,0:48:37.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是第一个提出拒绝的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are almost the first to refuse it
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.79,0:48:40.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的拒绝会使国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your refusal will cause the King's highness
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.25,0:48:42.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你产生愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be both indignant
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.93,0:48:44.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and suspicious of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.50,0:48:47.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是国会下院已宣誓的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here are all the members of the Commons and the Lords
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.44,0:48:49.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有成员和大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who have sworn to take the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.23,0:48:52.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 还有神职人员 - 我不能宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- The clergy too. - I myself cannot swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:55.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不会责怪任何宣誓的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do not blame any other man who has sworn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.87,0:48:57.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯阁下 我们已经断定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas,we have come to the conclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.98,0:49:00.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你完全不是一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that,far from being
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.29,0:49:04.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对国王陛下真诚 忠心耿耿的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a true and loyal servant to His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.66,0:49:08.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是一个前所未有的邪恶 叛逆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there never was a servant so villainous,so traitorous
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.37,0:49:09.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对自己的殿下如此不忠之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to his prince as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.15,0:49:12.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你拒绝宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you refuse to take the oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.99,0:49:14.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不但会入狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not only will you be imprisoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.80,0:49:19.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更有你想象不到的酷刑在等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the most horrid things imaginable will be done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.20,0:49:22.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 这些吓唬孩子可以 对我没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords,these threats are for children,not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.90,0:49:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you deny
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.47,0:49:30.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你曾威胁诱导国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you bullied and persuaded the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.32,0:49:31.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违背他自己的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against his conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.97,0:49:35.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 写下这本反对路德的册子 - 我当然否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- to write this pamphlet against Luther? - Of course I deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.87,0:49:38.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先我决不会强迫任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the first place I would never ask anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.87,0:49:40.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论他身份高贵或贫贱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be he ever so high or so low,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.64,0:49:43.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去做他们不愿做的事 第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to act against his conscience. And secondly,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.78,0:49:46.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得反而是国王告诫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember it was His Majesty who rather persuaded me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.97,0:49:49.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇职位的重要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the paramount importance of the papacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.25,0:49:54.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再问你最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you a final time,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.74,0:49:57.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你被处以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before the awful penalties
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.26,0:49:59.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怕的刑罚之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are exacted upon you:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.28,0:50:04.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么不宣誓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why will you not swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.44,0:50:12.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么不宣誓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why will you not swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.66,0:50:28.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,Madge!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.89,0:50:33.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 怎么了？- 玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Madge!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.64,0:50:35.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道 只是很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.57,0:50:39.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.30,0:50:44.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我喜欢你笑起来时候的酒窝 玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like your dimples when you laugh,Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:50.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.54,0:50:53.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.05,0:50:58.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.60,0:51:15.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.53,0:51:18.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离近一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}examine your dimples
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.44,0:51:21.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仔细端详你的酒窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a little more closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.94,0:51:28.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.62,0:51:30.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.93,0:51:37.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对了 殿下也许会乐于知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh... Your Highness might like to know that the Reverend Fisher
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.71,0:51:39.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔神父就被关在你的下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is lodged in the room down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.44,0:51:42.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你有好心情 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day to you,sir.
